{"ref":"BDB, סֵ֫בֶל","hw":"סֵ֫בֶל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סֵ֫בֶל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>load, burden</strong>;—abs. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.11\">Ne 4:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:7\" href=\"/Psalms.81.7\">ψ 81:7</a> (enforced burden); cstr. <em>id.</em>, = <em>burdensome labour</em> (of <em>corvée</em>) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.28\">1 K 11:28</a>.—Vid. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, סַבָּל\" href=\"/BDB,_סַבָּל\", dir=\"rtl\">סַבָּל</a>.","next":"BDB, סֹ֫בֶל","prev":"BDB, סָבַל"}